+  <script src="/js/auth-header.js" defer></script>
+</head>
+<body>
+<th:block th:fragment="header">
+  <a class="ml-skip" href="#main">본문으로 이동</a>
+  <header class="ml-header"><div class="ml-header-inner">
+    <a href="/" class="ml-brand" aria-label="movieLife 홈"><img src="/images/logo.png" alt="movieLife" width="158" height="57"></a>
+    <nav class="ml-nav" aria-label="주 메뉴">
+      <a href="/" data-nav="home">홈</a><a href="/movies" data-nav="movies">영화</a>
+      <a href="/movies/domestic" data-nav="domestic">국내영화</a><a href="/movies/foreign" data-nav="foreign">해외영화</a>
+      <a href="/recommend" data-nav="recommend">영화추천</a><a href="/ott" data-nav="ott">OTT</a><a href="/mypage" data-nav="mypage">마이페이지</a>
+    </nav>
+    <form class="ml-search" action="/movies" method="get" role="search">
+      <input type="search" name="query" placeholder="영화 제목을 검색해 보세요" aria-label="영화 제목 검색" maxlength="100" required th:value="${query}">
+      <button type="submit" aria-label="검색"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg></button>
+    </form>
+    <div class="ml-auth"><a href="/login" data-login-link>로그인</a><a href="/signup" class="signup-link">회원가입</a></div>
+  </div></header>
+</th:block>
+<footer class="ml-footer" th:fragment="footer"><div class="shell footer-inner">
+  <div><a href="/" class="footer-brand">movie<span>Life</span></a><p>영화를 발견하고, 나만의 감상을 기록하는 공간.</p></div>
+  <div class="footer-meta"><p>영화 정보 · TMDB / 시청 정보 · JustWatch</p><p>This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p><p>© movieLife · Team Project</p></div>
+</div></footer>
+<article class="movie-card" th:fragment="card(movie)">
